{
  "chapter": 10,
  "title": "Zhou Shen Victory",
  "scriptId": "ch1099",
  "endReturnScreen": "selector",
  "entries": [
    {
      "speaker": "Zhou Shen",
      "text": "You trembled, but you did not retreat.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "assets/vn/backgrounds/deadline/zhoushen_story.png",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "assets/combat/bgm/zhouShenStory.wav",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "I thought my heart was going to explode the whole time.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Zhou Shen",
      "text": "Hearts do that when they are still attached to a dream.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Everyone keeps making dreams sound beautiful right before they ruin my life.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Zhou Shen",
      "text": "They are beautiful because they ruin the quiet life you could have settled for.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "...",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Zhou Shen",
      "text": "Do not measure yourself against legends as though they were born complete. We all become ourselves by continuing.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "So I just keep going?",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Zhou Shen",
      "text": "Yes. Keep going, keep singing, keep becoming.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Zhou Shen",
      "text": "The stage does not ask whether you are worthy before you step onto it.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Then I'll earn my place while I'm already standing there.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Zhou Shen",
      "text": "Good. That answer will carry you farther than fear.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    }
  ]
}
